2026-09-24T15:53:32.3728485Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T15:53:32.3728914Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T15:53:32.3729326Z   ccache: |
